      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11396108::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A disordered FCC matrix containing dispersed γ′ precipitates has greater phase stability than a single-phase disordered baseline.",
