      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11396108::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The γ + γ′ microstructure improves environmental resistance relative to the single-phase baseline.",
